{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22440","headline":"秋槿 · 白居易","name":"秋槿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风露飒已冷，天色亦黄昏。\n中庭有槿花，荣落同一晨。\n秋开已寂莫，夕陨何纷纷。\n正怜少颜色，复叹不逡巡。\n感此因念彼，怀哉聊一陈。\n男儿老富贵，女子晚婚姻。\n头白始得志，色衰方事人。\n後时不获已，安得如青春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22440.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22440","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}